{"type": "root", "attrs": {"type": "rig_component", "tags": "apex", "since": "20.5", "index": "no"}, "body": [{"level": 0, "type": "title", "indent": 0, "text": ["Blend Shape"], "extent": [58, 74]}, {"type": "summary", "indent": 0, "text": ["Adds blend shapes with controls to an APEX rig."], "extent": [74, 130]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This component adds blend shapes with controls to an APEX rig. The setup process is the same as in KineFX - add blend shapes to the capture mesh using the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--characterblendshapesadd", "type": "link", "text": ["Character Blend Shapes Add SOP"], "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--characterblendshapesadd.html"}, ", then add the capture mesh to the rig. The blendshape component then extracts the blend shapes, and sets up the graph with controls for each of the blend shapes that are present in the mesh."], "extent": [130, 551]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["The control for each blend shape is an ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/animationgraphs#abstract_controls", "type": "link", "text": ["abstract control"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/animationgraphs.html#abstract_controls", "fragment": "#abstract_controls"}, " that is set to a ", {"type": "code", "text": ["ball"]}, " shape by default. The parent of the abstract control is a ", {"type": "code", "text": ["circle_wires"]}, " shape (see the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/apex--configurecontrols#shapeoverride", "type": "link", "text": ["built-in APEX control shapes"], "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/apex--configurecontrols.html#shapeoverride", "fragment": "#shapeoverride"}, "). This parent control is used to position the blend shape control. "], "extent": [551, 920]}, {"type": "fig_group", "body": [{"ext": null, "type": "fig", "indent": 0, "text": [" ", {"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/char/kinefx_rigcomponents_blendshapecontrol.jpg", "type": "img", "text": ""}], "role": "item", "extent": [920, 990], "body": [{"type": "summary", "indent": 8, "text": ["Blend shape control"], "extent": [1018, 1053]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"display": "half left"}}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 1, "id": "parameters", "container": true, "type": "parameters_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [1053, 1065], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Prefix"], "extent": [1065, 1074], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The prefix that is added to the blendshape subnet created by this component."], "extent": [1074, 1156]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Guide Source"], "extent": [1156, 1170], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/preparingskeletons", "type": "link", "text": ["guide skeleton"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/preparingskeletons.html"}, " that is used as a reference for setting the hierarchy and positions of the blend shape controls. "], "extent": [1170, 1332]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Settings"], "extent": [1332, 1347], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Base Skeleton"], "extent": [1347, 1363], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The skeleton to apply the animation channels to. This is the standard KineFX blend shape workflow."], "extent": [1363, 1467]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Base Shape"], "extent": [1467, 1479], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The capture mesh to deform."], "extent": [1479, 1512]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Bone Deform"], "extent": [1512, 1525], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/bonedeform", "type": "link", "text": ["sop::bonedeform"], "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/bonedeform.html"}, " node that the blend shape subnet connects to."], "extent": [1525, 1618]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Remove Port Prefix"], "extent": [1618, 1638], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["When turned on, removes the prefixes on the blend shape controls. "], "extent": [1638, 1711]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}]}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Parents"], "extent": [1711, 1725], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Parent"], "extent": [1725, 1734], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The main parent for all the blend shape controls."], "extent": [1734, 1789]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Control Offset"], "extent": [1789, 1805], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The offset when multiple controls are added to a single parent."], "extent": [1805, 1874]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Parent Custom"], "extent": [1874, 1889], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The parent of each blend shape control."], "extent": [1889, 1934]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Blend"], "extent": [1934, 1941], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The name of the blend shape, for example, ", {"type": "code", "text": ["L_Blink"]}, "."], "extent": [1941, 1999]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Parent"], "extent": [1999, 2007], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The parent of the blend shape control."], "extent": [2007, 2051]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Offset"], "extent": [2051, 2059], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The offset of the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend"]}, " control from its ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Parent"]}, "."], "extent": [2059, 2122]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}]}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Shape"], "extent": [2122, 2134], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Guide Scale"], "extent": [2134, 2148], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The scale of the abstract control\u2019s parent."], "extent": [2148, 2197]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Shape"], "extent": [2197, 2204], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The shape of the abstract controls. It can be set to any of the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/apex--configurecontrols#shapeoverride", "type": "link", "text": ["built-in APEX control shapes"], "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/apex--configurecontrols.html#shapeoverride", "fragment": "#shapeoverride"}, "."], "extent": [2204, 2352]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Scale"], "extent": [2352, 2359], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The scale of the abstract control shapes."], "extent": [2359, 2406]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}]}], "text": "Parameters"}, {"level": 1, "id": "related", "container": true, "type": "related_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [2406, 2415], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/animationgraphs#abstract_controls", "type": "link", "t